{"path":"types/type_info/hash_code","title":"std::type_info::hash_code","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::type_info::</span>hash_code","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/type_info/hash_code","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Returns an unspecified value (here denoted by hash code) such that for all std::type_info objects referring to the same type, their hash code is the same.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> hash_code<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns an unspecified value (here denoted by <i>hash code</i>) such that for all <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\">std::type_info</a></span> objects referring to the same type, their <i>hash code</i> is the same.\n</p><p>No other guarantees are given: <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\">std::type_info</a></span> objects referring to different types may have the same <i>hash code</i> (although the standard recommends that implementations avoid this as much as possible), and <i>hash code</i> for the same type can change between invocations of the same program.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A value that is identical for all <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\">std::type_info</a></span> objects referring to the same type.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following program is an example of an efficient type-value mapping without using <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\">std::type_index</a></span>.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;typeinfo&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;unordered_map&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> A\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> ~A<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> B <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> A <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> C <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> A <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> TypeInfoRef <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/reference_wrapper\"><span class=\"kw1075\">std::<span class=\"me2\">reference_wrapper</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\"><span class=\"kw453\">std::<span class=\"me2\">type_info</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Hasher\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>TypeInfoRef code<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> code.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">hash_code</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> EqualTo\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>TypeInfoRef lhs, TypeInfoRef rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> lhs.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_map\"><span class=\"kw1301\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unordered_map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>TypeInfoRef, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a>, Hasher, EqualTo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> type_names<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"int\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"double\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>A<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>B<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"B\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>C<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"C\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    A a<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// note that we're storing pointer to type A</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\"><span class=\"kw737\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>A<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b<span class=\"br0\">(</span>new B<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\"><span class=\"kw737\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>A<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> c<span class=\"br0\">(</span>new C<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"i is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"d is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>d<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"a is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"*b is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"*c is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> type_names<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>i is int\nd is double\na is A\n*b is B\n*c is C</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info/operator_cmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator==</span><span>operator!=</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the objects refer to the same type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info/name\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>name</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implementation defined name of the type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)"},{"path":"types/type_info","title":"std::type_info"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::type_info::hash_code","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns an unspecified value (here denoted by hash code) such that for all std::type_info objects referring to the…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A value that is identical for all std::type_info objects referring to the same type."},{"labe